     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear MSstats users,<div><br></div><div>In Bioconductor v3.4 (from November 2016), MSstats v3.6 is released. </div><div>We just found that there are some installation issue for this new version. The installation from Bioconductor should be followed.</div><div><br></div><div>1. Run below.</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\">source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232061914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LAXqqV2MxeOsvMD6Flmrv\">https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R</a>&quot;</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span></div></code>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div>Then, you should see</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#606\">Bioconductor</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.4</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">BiocInstaller</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.24</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#000\">biocLite </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> help</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div>If you see, &#39;Bioconductor version 3.3&#39;, the older version of MSstats, v3.4 or v3.3.12 will be installed. Then Run below, it will upgrade the bioconductor version</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><p><span><span style=\"color:#000\">biocLite</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BiocUpgrade&quot;</span><span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span></p></div></code></div><div><br></div>Then, check again, whether it says Bioconduction version 3.4 or not.</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><p><span><span style=\"color:#000\">source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232061914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LAXqqV2MxeOsvMD6Flmrv\">https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R</a>&quot;</span><span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span></p></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>2. Install MSstats. All related packages will be installed.<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><p><span style=\"color:#000\">biocLite</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MSstats&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></p></div></code></div><br>3. load MSstats and check MSstats version.</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">MSstats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">?</span><span style=\"color:#606\">MSstats</span></font></div></code></div><div><br></div>Please check the help file says MSstats version 3.6 (or v 3.5.6 also fine) or not.</div><div><br></div><div><br><br><br></div></div>"
    ]
